 "decision": "The source of the Digitakt II core 1.1 (OS 1.17) and the header that describes its additions to mods, copied unchanged from toonst's elekloader branch as the starting point of Modwerk's own Digitakt II base (owner decision for every machine, 28 October 2026: docs/MACHINE_RECIPE.md). The commit is elekloader#221 rebased on elekloader's main (7d0bf15) and cut to what a mod needs: core 1.1 adds ev_frame_params, ev_key_leds, the mods' project and kit data (core_projdata, core_kitdata, with core_kit_on and core_kitdata_room), value rows (core_addvalue) and fw_led_set to the six events of core 1.0, which stays what the site builds with until the base ships. It replaces the record of 3d7c2e3, whose core_notice, core_view_top, core_kit_index and other fw_* exports it no longer has. mods/core-dt2/mod.json is the recipe: it builds mods/core/core.s, settings.s and fast.s with the Digitakt II's addresses, and the files beside it. GPL-2.0-or-later, each source keeps its SPDX line; the core is irpina's, the 1.1 additions toonst's. Not built or run by this record; the build and its identity come with the machine's base.",
